{"id":"brille","lemma":"Brille","pos":"noun","rank":1796,"glosses":["glasses, spectacles (frames bearing two lenses worn in front of the eyes to correct vision)","goggles (protective eyewear set in a flexible frame to fit snugly against the face)","nasal cannula for oxygen (clear plastic tubes for the delivery of oxygen to the nose)"],"ipa":"/ˈbʁɪlə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/De-at-Brille.ogg/De-at-Brille.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Brille","plural":"Brillen"},"formAudio":{"Brillen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Brillen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Gib mir meine Brille.","en":"Give me my glasses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393293","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Diese Brillen sind schön.","en":"These glasses are beautiful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566419","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"well, beautifully"}]},{"text":"Ich habe meine Brille verloren.","en":"I lost my glasses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394934","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Was sagst du zu meiner Brille?","en":"What do you think of my glasses?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694862","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Sind das meine Brillen?","en":"Are those my glasses?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]}]}